  "fullDescription": "🎒 Kawaii Back to School Digital Paper Bundle – 10 Digital Paper Patterns\n\nMake every school-themed project extra cute with this adorable Kawaii Back to School Digital Paper Bundle! ✏️📚 Inspired by the playful kawaii aesthetic, this collection brings a cheerful, charming touch to your creative designs. Perfect for school lovers, teachers, students, crafters, and DIY enthusiasts, these digital papers are wonderful for celebrating the excitement of a brand-new school year.\n\nWhether you’re creating colorful scrapbook pages, decorating planners, designing stationery, making classroom crafts, or preparing school-themed invitations, this bundle offers plenty of inspiration for your next creative adventure. Add a little kawaii magic to your projects and make every design feel fun and special!\n\n✨ Product Details\n\n🎒 Product Name: Kawaii Back to School Digital Paper\n\n🎨 Quantity: 10 unique digital paper patterns\n\n📦 File Delivery: All patterns included in 1 ZIP file\n\n🖨️ Resolution: High-resolution 300 DPI\n\n📐 File Dimensions: 4500 × 4500 pixels\n\n📏 Print Size: 15″ × 15″ at 300 DPI\n\n💻 Product Type: Digital download\n\n🎁 Perfect For\n\n📚 Back-to-school scrapbooking and junk journals\n\n✏️ School-themed invitations and greeting cards\n\n🎒 Classroom crafts and educational projects\n\n📔 Planners, notebooks, and journal covers\n\n💌 Cute stationery and printable designs\n\n🎀 Gift tags, labels, and creative packaging\n\n🖼️ Digital art and school-themed graphics\n\n✂️ DIY crafts for teachers, students, and families\n\n💖 Why You’ll Love This Collection\n\nBring cuteness and creativity together with this delightful kawaii-inspired school paper collection! With 10 high-resolution digital paper patterns conveniently packaged in one ZIP file, you’ll have versatile resources for a variety of school-themed crafts, stationery, and printable projects.\n\nWhether you’re preparing for a new semester, creating something special for a teacher, or designing adorable planner pages, these digital papers will add a playful and cheerful touch to your creations.\n\n📌 Please Note\n\nThis is a digital product. No physical item will be shipped.\n\nAll 10 digital paper patterns are included in one ZIP file.\n\nColors may vary slightly depending on your monitor, printer, and printing settings.\n\nPlease ensure your device supports ZIP files before purchasing.\n\n🌈 Make your school-themed creations irresistibly cute with the Kawaii Back to School Digital Paper Bundle!",
